WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.830
<b>Shoot, I messed up the beginning.</b>

00:02.830 --> 00:05.210
<b>Really? It didn't sound bad.</b>

00:07.170 --> 00:09.000
<b>I might have to retake the exam.</b>

00:14.750 --> 00:16.040
<b>Someday when you're famous</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:18.290
<b>Delete Photo</b>

00:16.040 --> 00:18.290
<b>Cancel</b>

00:18.290 --> 00:19.500
<b>Photo Deleted</b>

00:30.130 --> 00:35.040
<b>When does one start being able to use magic?</b>

00:30.130 --> 00:35.040
<b>Mahou wa itsukara tsukaeru yoni narunoka</b>

00:35.170 --> 00:39.920
<b>I always aspired for something special</b>

00:35.170 --> 00:39.920
<b>Tokubetsu na nanika ni zutto akogareteta</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:45.080
<b>1, 2, 3 and fall in line B, C, D, eternally a good girl</b>

00:40.210 --> 00:45.080
<b>1 2 3 de maenarae B C D iiko ni suru no wa</b>

00:45.210 --> 00:50.670
<b>I know more than anyone that's not who I am</b>

00:45.210 --> 00:50.670
<b>Watashi janai tte watashi ga ichiban shitteirunda</b>

00:51.540 --> 00:57.250
<b>None of us think things are fine the way they are</b>

00:51.540 --> 00:57.250
<b>Konomama de ii nante dare mo omocchanai yo</b>

00:57.250 --> 01:00.040
<b>Anxious, both feet are heavy</b>

00:57.250 --> 01:00.040
<b>Aseru ryouashi ga omoi no</b>

01:01.040 --> 01:04.750
<b>Even you, so close at hand</b>

01:01.040 --> 01:04.750
<b>Konna ni chikaku ni iru kimi ni sae</b>

01:04.880 --> 01:09.460
<b>Still frustratingly hard to reach, but these eyes can see</b>

01:04.880 --> 01:09.460
<b>Modokashii hodo todokanai noni kono me ga utsushita</b>

01:09.710 --> 01:15.330
<b>Brightness, so colorful, so full of variety</b>

01:09.710 --> 01:15.330
<b>Irotoridori yoridori midori no mei</b>

01:15.330 --> 01:20.330
<b>However many times I get fed up, I resonate with you</b>

01:15.330 --> 01:20.330
<b>Nando datte mou iyannatatte kimi to kyoumei</b>

01:20.540 --> 01:25.290
<b>Break through thoughts almost stuck in a loop</b>

01:20.540 --> 01:25.290
<b>Loop shisou na shikou o yabutte</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.920
<b>Mayday to gloomy days, I soar through the air</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.920
<b>Yuutsu na hibi ni mayday watashi wa chuu o matte</b>

01:29.920 --> 01:34.580
<b>Sink my teeth into the edge of the cloudy sky</b>

01:29.920 --> 01:34.580
<b>Kumorizora no fuchi ni kaburitsuki</b>

01:34.750 --> 01:38.290
<b>And gulp down the bitter, sour, salty</b>

01:34.750 --> 01:38.290
<b>Nomikomu nigai suppai shoppai igai ni</b>

01:38.290 --> 01:42.540
<b>Or maybe it'll be surprisingly sweet</b>

01:38.290 --> 01:42.540
<b>Amai no kamoshirenai na</b>

01:44.920 --> 01:51.670
<b>Ah, I go toward where the light shines in</b>

01:44.920 --> 01:51.670
<b>Hikari no sashikomu hou e ikunda</b>

01:59.040 --> 02:05.210
<b>Let my colors reach someone, always, always</b>

02:00.830 --> 02:02.330
<b>Some masked girl took over my live street gig</b>

02:00.830 --> 02:02.330
<b>20K views 5 days ago #Miiko #LiveGig #17forLife #PoorMe</b>

02:00.830 --> 02:02.330
<b>Miiko's Channel</b>

02:01.630 --> 02:02.330
<b>Hey!</b>

02:05.500 --> 02:08.580
<b>If I'm around you, maybe I'll be able to shine, too?</b>

02:11.750 --> 02:15.000
<b>Argh, why would I go and say something so cringey?!</b>

02:15.000 --> 02:17.500
<b>I'm so, so embarrassed! So embarrassed I could die!</b>

02:17.500 --> 02:18.290
<b>Keep it down!</b>

02:20.420 --> 02:22.920
<b>What? Are you coming down with
a case of middle school delusions?</b>

02:22.920 --> 02:25.080
<b>What does a fifth-grader know about middle school?</b>

02:30.210 --> 02:33.460
<b>Huh, have you taken up drawing again?</b>

02:35.380 --> 02:36.630
<b>You have a problem with that?</b>

02:37.420 --> 02:38.670
<b>No.</b>

02:39.040 --> 02:43.380
<b>Well, guess life just has its hellos and goodbyes.</b>

02:43.580 --> 02:46.420
<b>Where do you learn stuff like that?</b>

02:51.540 --> 02:53.830
<b>Good work on your first day, girls.</b>

02:54.210 --> 02:56.500
<b>Go ahead and take a break together.</b>

02:56.500 --> 02:57.670
<b>Okay!</b>

02:59.130 --> 03:03.290
<b>I thought we need an inviting character for your icon.</b>

03:03.750 --> 03:04.630
<b>What do you think?</b>

03:04.830 --> 03:08.880
<b>Oooh! A drawing by my favorite artist, Yoru!</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:12.250
<b>Little JELEE</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:12.250
<b>jellyfish motif</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:12.250
<b>Rough Sketch 1</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:12.250
<b>feel of ocean depths</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:12.250
<b>bandaids</b>

03:08.880 --> 03:11.920
<b>Aw, thanks. It's still a rough sketch, though.</b>

03:15.210 --> 03:17.290
<b>I think we have just enough time.</b>

03:19.500 --> 03:20.380
<b>For what?</b>

03:21.210 --> 03:22.330
<b>Lemme show you.</b>

03:23.250 --> 03:26.790
<b>Announcing the production schedule
for a JELEE original song!</b>

03:27.000 --> 03:29.750
<b>November 10th, I finish writing uber emotional lyrics!</b>

03:29.750 --> 03:32.080
<b>17th, you come out with the best art ever!</b>

03:32.080 --> 03:33.920
<b>Uh, the 17th?!</b>

03:34.210 --> 03:36.880
<b>No way, I have school fair preparations and stuff!</b>

03:36.880 --> 03:39.960
<b>Sometime in November, we're blessed with godly music!</b>

03:39.960 --> 03:40.960
<b>Sometime?</b>

03:40.960 --> 03:45.630
<b>And some month, someday, ASAP, we'll finish
a wicked amazing music video! And go viral!</b>

03:45.630 --> 03:46.880
<b>That's way too vague.</b>

03:47.000 --> 03:52.040
<b>Jelee's</b>

03:47.000 --> 03:52.040
<b>schedule</b>

03:47.000 --> 03:52.040
<b>for the win</b>

03:47.080 --> 03:48.750
<b>W-well, yeah...</b>

03:48.750 --> 03:50.790
<b>And the schedule's totally unreasonable.</b>

03:50.790 --> 03:51.670
<b>But...</b>

03:52.170 --> 03:55.420
<b>Besides, that "godly music"? Who's gonna compose that?</b>

03:55.420 --> 03:57.380
<b>Me, of course.</b>

03:57.380 --> 03:59.040
<b>Huh? You can write music, Kano?</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.000
<b>Composing</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.000
<b>Made Easy</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.000
<b>for Gyaru:</b>

03:59.040 --> 04:00.000
<b>Ultimate Edition</b>

03:59.330 --> 04:00.750
<b>I'll pull an all-nighter and learn!</b>

04:00.000 --> 04:00.750
<b>Composing</b>

04:00.000 --> 04:00.750
<b>Made Easy</b>

04:00.000 --> 04:00.750
<b>for Gyaru:</b>

04:00.000 --> 04:00.750
<b>Ultimate Edition</b>

04:00.960 --> 04:02.750
<b>Guess we should find someone else who can.</b>

04:02.750 --> 04:03.880
<b>You meanie!</b>

04:04.330 --> 04:07.460
<b>Are we gonna be all right?</b>

04:08.790 --> 04:11.880
<b>Hey, am I like, getting way ahead of myself?</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:16.000
<b>Never mind. I signed up for this already.</b>

04:16.250 --> 04:21.000
<b>And me wanting to draw something to your songs...
That much is true, at least.</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:24.500
<b>Yoru!</b>

04:24.500 --> 04:26.750
<b>Thank you, I love you!</b>

04:26.750 --> 04:28.420
<b>Okay, okay. I appreciate the-</b>

04:37.250 --> 04:40.790
<b>Well, that's that for the composing...
which we haven't figured out.</b>

04:41.330 --> 04:45.710
<b>But we need equipment, too.
Will our combined pay from this job be enough?</b>

04:45.960 --> 04:48.080
<b>I'm really particular about the sound, so...</b>

04:48.080 --> 04:49.380
<b>Oh! Look at this.</b>

04:51.040 --> 04:54.630
<b>900,000 yen?! Regrettably,
Yoru will be moving onto her next project.</b>

04:54.630 --> 04:55.880
<b>We're over?!</b>

04:56.380 --> 04:58.250
<b>Well then, guess it's time to whip out</b>

04:58.250 --> 05:00.880
<b>my secret weapon: the donation box!</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:00.880
<b>Support for</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:00.880
<b>Jelee Box</b>

05:00.880 --> 05:03.000
<b>Kano, could it be you're actually really stupid?</b>

05:03.290 --> 05:04.580
<b>Don't assume it won't work!</b>

05:04.580 --> 05:08.040
<b>They say there are these people
called "patrons" somewhere in the world.</b>

05:08.420 --> 05:11.040
<b>No way it'll work out just like that!</b>

05:11.040 --> 05:14.750
<b>Besides, we'll get yelled at by the owner!</b>

05:14.750 --> 05:16.710
<b>No worries, it'll work out somehow!</b>

05:18.040 --> 05:19.960
<b>Oh. We've actually closed up for the-</b>

05:30.210 --> 05:33.250
<b>One, two... A-a hundred thousand yen?!</b>

05:33.630 --> 05:36.500
<b>Are you... what people call a "patron"?</b>

05:40.170 --> 05:42.580
<b>Yes, I've come to fulfill my duties as a fan.</b>

05:43.580 --> 05:46.210
<b>Episode 2                     Mei the Fangirl</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:54.170
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

05:54.790 --> 05:57.330
<b>You're a fan from Kano's Sundoll days?</b>

05:57.710 --> 05:58.500
<b>Yes.</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:01.000
<b>I have all her CDs and DVDs.</b>

06:01.420 --> 06:02.670
<b>Five copies of each.</b>

06:03.040 --> 06:03.880
<b>Five copies?</b>

06:04.210 --> 06:06.540
<b>Wow, really?! Thanks so much!</b>

06:06.830 --> 06:08.630
<b>But how did you find her here?</b>

06:08.630 --> 06:15.500
<b>Let my colors reach someone, always, always</b>

06:10.250 --> 06:12.380
<b>Some masked girl took over my live street gig</b>

06:10.250 --> 06:12.380
<b>Miiko's Channel</b>

06:10.710 --> 06:11.630
<b>Hey!</b>

06:10.920 --> 06:13.170
<b>I heard this voice, and thought it might be her.</b>

06:13.540 --> 06:17.330
<b>But the singing style was different
and I wasn't completely sure.</b>

06:17.330 --> 06:18.960
<b>But look right here!</b>

06:19.290 --> 06:24.750
<b>This faceline... that streamlined nose! This beautiful
Cleopatra-like face just had to be Nono-tan!</b>

06:25.080 --> 06:27.000
<b>I kinda get where she's coming from.</b>

06:29.250 --> 06:32.210
<b>It was thanks to that, coupled with
Nono-tan's tendency to be careless.</b>

06:32.460 --> 06:34.920
<b>Yikes, so this is how you track someone down...</b>

06:34.080 --> 06:36.460
<b>Got a part-time job</b>

06:34.080 --> 06:36.460
<b>#JELEE #Shibuya</b>

06:34.080 --> 06:36.460
<b>Gonna save up</b>

06:34.090 --> 06:36.460
<b>to buy equipment!!</b>

06:35.420 --> 06:40.500
<b>I'm happy for the support, but I'm retired, y'know?
So tracking me down's not-</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:41.460
<b>Not on my watch.</b>

06:41.670 --> 06:42.250
<b>Huh?</b>

06:45.880 --> 06:47.330
<b>I refuse to acknowledge this!</b>

06:47.540 --> 06:50.130
<b>Nono-tan has to keep singing with the Sundolls!</b>

06:50.330 --> 06:54.920
<b>None of this bleached hair, just tasteful black locks!
And I'll provide the funds, so quit this job right now.</b>

06:54.920 --> 06:57.750
<b>And you're showing too much leg.
Cover it up this instant!</b>

06:57.750 --> 06:59.630
<b>This betrays all my expectations!</b>

07:01.380 --> 07:02.750
<b>She's one of those.</b>

07:03.000 --> 07:07.670
<b>Are you the fiend who led
Nono-tan astray?! Or a rabid fan?!</b>

07:07.880 --> 07:09.790
<b>I have to get that from you?</b>

07:10.750 --> 07:11.330
<b>Hold on.</b>

07:12.420 --> 07:14.210
<b>Kano! She stole your bag!</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:16.380
<b>You're wrong, this is mine!</b>

07:16.380 --> 07:18.330
<b>But no ordinary person would carry
around a weird design like-</b>

07:18.330 --> 07:20.790
<b>Hey, that's the novelty bag that I designed!</b>

07:21.000 --> 07:21.580
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:21.790 --> 07:22.880
<b>Mine's...</b>

07:23.920 --> 07:24.670
<b>right there.</b>

07:24.880 --> 07:27.670
<b>Two out of only twenty in the world are here, right now!</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:29.790
<b>I've never seen anyone with that thing.</b>

07:30.330 --> 07:33.130
<b>I lost out in the lottery so I bought it on Mercaru!</b>

07:33.130 --> 07:35.040
<b>Wasn't the price pretty jacked up?</b>

07:35.420 --> 07:37.920
<b>That doesn't matter. I'm your biggest fan!</b>

07:38.290 --> 07:39.790
<b>And what about this money?</b>

07:40.210 --> 07:42.080
<b>It's a tribute of love, from me.</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:45.330
<b>Use it to fund you getting back on your feet, Nono-tan.</b>

07:46.000 --> 07:48.630
<b>You shouldn't be wasting your time here.
Be an idol again and-</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:49.460
<b>I don't want it.</b>

07:50.170 --> 07:50.920
<b>Huh?</b>

08:00.000 --> 08:01.040
<b>Take it with you.</b>

08:01.540 --> 08:05.500
<b>Unfortunately, Nonoka Tachibana is gone.</b>

08:13.960 --> 08:16.040
<b>Uh, look...</b>

08:16.040 --> 08:17.000
<b>You liar!</b>

08:23.210 --> 08:26.580
<b>I should've just taken it!</b>

08:26.920 --> 08:28.250
<b>She's an emotional rollercoaster.</b>

08:28.460 --> 08:31.330
<b>I mean, 100,000 yen?! We earn 1,000 yen per hour, so...</b>

08:31.330 --> 08:32.960
<b>Don't calculate that.</b>

08:32.960 --> 08:34.080
<b>But c'mon!</b>

08:34.080 --> 08:38.750
<b>True, not getting the 100,000 yen hurts,
but you were pretty cool back there, Kano.</b>

08:39.040 --> 08:40.880
<b>Not at the moment, though.</b>

08:41.750 --> 08:47.080
<b>Really? If you say so, guess I'll give up on
the 100,000 yen and work to save up!</b>

08:50.790 --> 08:51.540
<b>Huh?</b>

08:52.000 --> 08:52.580
<b>Hmm?</b>

08:52.960 --> 08:54.080
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:55.420 --> 08:57.210
<b>Ahhhh!</b>

09:03.420 --> 09:05.460
<b>I'm sure she'll realize and get in touch.</b>

09:05.960 --> 09:08.080
<b>She already tracked down your job, after all.</b>

09:08.460 --> 09:11.170
<b>Can we count on that?
Maybe there's something in here...</b>

09:11.170 --> 09:13.210
<b>Are you sure? What if you find something disturbing?</b>

09:13.210 --> 09:14.880
<b>Like a listening device or a spy camera or-</b>

09:18.580 --> 09:20.080
<b>I-is it a listening device?!</b>

09:20.080 --> 09:21.080
<b>Calm down...</b>

09:32.710 --> 09:33.670
<b>This music!</b>

09:33.670 --> 09:35.330
<b>It's "Colorful Moonlight"!</b>

09:35.330 --> 09:36.750
<b>What a cool arrangement.</b>

09:37.000 --> 09:38.500
<b>Much cooler than mine.</b>

09:38.920 --> 09:40.920
<b>Folder 1</b>

09:38.920 --> 09:40.920
<b>Track 1</b>

09:39.920 --> 09:42.080
<b>She must've done this... right?</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:47.630
<b>Jeez, I really suck, huh?</b>

09:47.630 --> 09:48.580
<b>Suck?</b>

09:48.580 --> 09:54.000
<b>She loved me this much for real and I was
so cold to her. I don't deserve to be an idol.</b>

09:54.250 --> 09:55.750
<b>But you quit, right?</b>

09:56.790 --> 09:58.290
<b>Well, sure...</b>

09:58.710 --> 10:03.210
<b>But wanting to care about my fans hasn't really changed.</b>

10:04.880 --> 10:06.920
<b>That's really you, Kano.</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:09.880
<b>What do you mean? I am Kano, duh.</b>

10:09.880 --> 10:11.040
<b>Oh, right.</b>

10:13.920 --> 10:15.330
<b>Is this by the Sundolls too?</b>

10:17.330 --> 10:18.630
<b>Kano?</b>

10:22.000 --> 10:24.290
<b>That sounds really good.</b>

10:26.420 --> 10:28.920
<b>I want to talk to that girl again.</b>

10:29.540 --> 10:34.330
<b>About this song too, but I think there's
a bunch of things I have to ask her.</b>

10:34.670 --> 10:36.170
<b>Do you think you'll get to?</b>

10:36.750 --> 10:39.790
<b>She really seemed obsessed with the old you, Kano.</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:45.330
<b>Tokyo University of Music and Art High School</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:45.330
<b>Student ID</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:45.330
<b>Department: Music Performance Major</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:45.330
<b>Name: Mei Kim Anouk Takanashi</b>

10:40.500 --> 10:42.880
<b>Mei Kim Anouk Takanashi...</b>

10:43.500 --> 10:47.330
<b>She might refuse, but I really want to talk to her.</b>

10:49.080 --> 10:52.210
<b>Um, hello? I'm supposed to be a superhero!</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>lmao</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>lolololol</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>lmao</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>Uh???</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>What? Really?</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:52.540
<b>lmao</b>

10:52.420 --> 10:54.880
<b>Jeez, whatever. That's all for today.</b>

10:52.540 --> 10:53.380
<b>Huh?</b>

10:52.540 --> 10:53.380
<b>Oh yeah I forgot</b>

10:52.540 --> 10:53.380
<b>lmao</b>

10:52.540 --> 10:53.380
<b>lolololololololol</b>

10:52.540 --> 10:53.380
<b>lmaooo</b>

10:52.550 --> 10:53.380
<b>Haven't heard that in a while.</b>

10:52.550 --> 10:53.380
<b>lmao</b>

10:54.880 --> 10:56.540
<b>Okay, goodbye for now, world!</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:01.630
<b>Wow, so you really started drawing again?</b>

11:01.960 --> 11:07.460
<b>Yeah. Thanks for the advice, when you're so busy
with your channel and the student council and all.</b>

11:06.880 --> 11:10.380
<b>Kiui Watase</b>

11:06.880 --> 11:10.380
<b>In Call</b>

11:08.420 --> 11:10.170
<b>You don't have to worry about me.</b>

11:10.750 --> 11:13.630
<b>More importantly, who's going to compose the music?</b>

11:14.000 --> 11:15.880
<b>Yeah, about that...</b>

11:18.080 --> 11:19.250
<b>Heya!</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:21.750
<b>Ooh! My fave artist in her school uniform!</b>

11:21.960 --> 11:23.380
<b>What a rare treat!</b>

11:23.630 --> 11:26.750
<b>Hi there. I wear this uniform five times a week, you know.</b>

11:27.040 --> 11:30.920
<b>You on the other hand... Stand out too much
if we're trying to catch her by surprise.</b>

11:32.380 --> 11:34.630
<b>Well, I hardly go to school at all, so...</b>

11:35.920 --> 11:37.000
<b>Hold it, Takanashi!</b>

11:37.420 --> 11:38.380
<b>Takanashi?</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:40.380
<b>What's with the sports jacket?!</b>

11:40.380 --> 11:41.210
<b>Huh?!</b>

11:41.830 --> 11:42.960
<b>She's wearing yours!</b>

11:41.960 --> 11:44.130
<b>You'd better shape up before the exam this afternoon!</b>

11:43.170 --> 11:44.830
<b>What?! Hey!</b>

11:44.130 --> 11:45.540
<b>In the big hall at 4:00 pm.</b>

11:46.210 --> 11:47.170
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

11:48.000 --> 11:51.540
<b>Well, I don't mind as long as I get it back,
but I actually wanted to-</b>

11:51.540 --> 11:54.710
<b>Umm! You wore this back in
your idol days too, didn't you?!</b>

11:54.920 --> 11:57.830
<b>Huh? Yeah, I've had this around for ages.</b>

11:58.250 --> 11:59.420
<b>I knew it!</b>

11:59.540 --> 12:02.330
<b>During Sundoll's fourth appearance on
the Idol Station show, you were wearing this,</b>

12:02.330 --> 12:04.080
<b>and that's when Mero almost messed up the choreo
and you stepped in to cover for her, right?!</b>

12:04.080 --> 12:06.000
<b>I realized then that you can sing and dance
but also take care of everyone around you,</b>

12:06.000 --> 12:06.960
<b>that you're an idol in the truest sense.</b>

12:06.960 --> 12:09.380
<b>And when I remembered that,
I put this on without even realizing it-</b>

12:10.040 --> 12:11.630
<b>About this piece.</b>

12:12.790 --> 12:15.330
<b>I composed it, but...</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:19.460
<b>I thought so! Honestly, I really like it!</b>

12:20.710 --> 12:23.040
<b>Do you know what we're doing as JELEE now?</b>

12:23.290 --> 12:26.000
<b>Yes. Starting with that street gig takeover in Shibuya,</b>

12:26.000 --> 12:29.630
<b>you're going to post songs online as an anonymous
artist with a jellyfish motif, aren't you?</b>

12:29.960 --> 12:31.460
<b>This girl knows everything.</b>

12:31.460 --> 12:33.080
<b>No need to explain then!</b>

12:33.460 --> 12:36.460
<b>Miss Takanashi, could you compose a song for JELEE?</b>

12:38.540 --> 12:41.210
<b>And who... will be singing that song?</b>

12:41.580 --> 12:43.210
<b>Me, of course.</b>

12:44.830 --> 12:47.830
<b>By "me," who do you mean?</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:51.000
<b>Who I am now.</b>

12:52.040 --> 12:53.420
<b>JELEE's vocal!</b>

12:54.580 --> 12:56.080
<b>Kano Yamanouchi will sing it!</b>

12:56.250 --> 12:57.130
<b>But I-!</b>

12:57.130 --> 12:58.000
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

12:59.080 --> 13:01.830
<b>Nonoka Tachibana's gone. Forever.</b>

13:05.080 --> 13:06.000
<b>...forgotten, then.</b>

13:08.380 --> 13:11.290
<b>Having you as Miss Yamanouchi sing my music</b>

13:12.000 --> 13:13.250
<b>goes against my expectations.</b>

13:15.500 --> 13:17.330
<b>I'm sorry to disappoint you,</b>

13:17.710 --> 13:20.580
<b>Miss Yamanouchi. And your manager, too.</b>

13:20.960 --> 13:22.790
<b>I'm not her manager.</b>

13:24.040 --> 13:26.420
<b>It's time. I have an exam to take.</b>

13:26.790 --> 13:27.750
<b>Please excuse me.</b>

13:36.670 --> 13:38.080
<b>There she goes.</b>

13:38.080 --> 13:39.210
<b>An exam, she said-</b>

13:39.210 --> 13:41.540
<b>Ahhh! I forgot to give these back!</b>

13:41.540 --> 13:43.000
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

13:43.290 --> 13:45.040
<b>Oops, I spilled that.</b>

13:45.750 --> 13:46.500
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:48.250 --> 13:49.920
<b>This hair color...</b>

13:54.170 --> 13:56.880
<b>To all second and third years...</b>

13:54.500 --> 13:56.880
<b>Two years ago</b>

13:58.210 --> 13:59.250
<b>How come you can't do this?</b>

14:00.000 --> 14:02.330
<b>The third years will be the focus of attention...</b>

14:02.790 --> 14:04.170
<b>Try again.</b>

14:05.000 --> 14:08.500
<b>I can only hope that this year will
be a fruitful one with no regrets...</b>

14:09.830 --> 14:10.880
<b>The people around you...</b>

14:10.880 --> 14:12.750
<b>Um, that's my seat...</b>

14:14.380 --> 14:17.210
<b>Listen, Miss Takanashi. Can you switch seats with me?</b>

14:17.540 --> 14:18.540
<b>Uh, but-</b>

14:18.540 --> 14:21.250
<b>We're all seated around your desk.</b>

14:21.750 --> 14:23.460
<b>That's gotta be awkward for you, right?</b>

14:23.880 --> 14:26.460
<b>Umm... you don't have to worry about me-</b>

14:26.460 --> 14:28.170
<b>Okay, that's not what I mean.</b>

14:29.380 --> 14:32.670
<b>Hey, give her a break. She's pretty bad
at reading social cues, y'know?</b>

14:33.330 --> 14:34.830
<b>I-I'm sorry.</b>

14:34.830 --> 14:36.420
<b>Who cares, anyway? Let's go.</b>

14:38.630 --> 14:39.580
<b>What a weird name.</b>

14:39.580 --> 14:41.250
<b>Hey, Kim'll hear you!</b>

14:41.580 --> 14:43.290
<b>I wish I could dye my hair, too.</b>

14:58.080 --> 15:00.580
<b>Yodogawa Camera</b>

14:58.080 --> 15:00.580
<b>Multimedia Kichijoji</b>

15:04.710 --> 15:07.580
<b>Sunflower Dolls</b>

15:04.710 --> 15:07.580
<b>Instax Photo Event</b>

15:07.580 --> 15:08.880
<b>Sunflower Dolls</b>

15:07.580 --> 15:08.880
<b>Instax Photo Event</b>

15:12.920 --> 15:13.920
<b>So cute!</b>

15:14.630 --> 15:15.630
<b>What a pretty face...</b>

15:17.750 --> 15:19.080
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

15:19.250 --> 15:22.130
<b>With a smile as bright as a sunflower,
I pull the group along!</b>

15:22.130 --> 15:26.580
<b>I'm the leader of the Sunflower Dolls, Nonoka
Tachibana, a.k.a. Nono-tan!</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:30.380
<b>Ack! Ack! So cute!</b>

15:32.210 --> 15:35.130
<b>Uh, a fan who's a girl! That makes me so happy!</b>

15:35.130 --> 15:36.420
<b>What's your name?</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:38.630
<b>Um...Kim-</b>

15:38.630 --> 15:39.960
<b>What a weird name.</b>

15:41.080 --> 15:43.130
<b>Kim... It's Kimura!</b>

15:43.330 --> 15:45.210
<b>Kimura, huh? Hi!</b>

15:45.540 --> 15:49.830
<b>Wow, you're so tall, your hair's awesome,
and you have such an attractive face.</b>

15:49.830 --> 15:50.710
<b>What's your deal?</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:54.790
<b>You're the cutest girl I've ever met, Kimura!</b>

15:55.080 --> 15:57.500
<b>I bet you tell everyone that.</b>

15:57.500 --> 15:59.710
<b>That retort wasn't cute, though!</b>

16:00.130 --> 16:01.000
<b>I mean...</b>

16:01.210 --> 16:06.250
<b>...I get a lot of flak about my hair,
and I don't have any friends, either.</b>

16:06.500 --> 16:08.630
<b>You don't have any friends, Kimura?!</b>

16:09.130 --> 16:10.960
<b>Why do you sound so happy?</b>

16:10.960 --> 16:13.460
<b>Because I don't have any, either!</b>

16:13.750 --> 16:15.080
<b>Even when your face is so pretty?!</b>

16:15.460 --> 16:17.210
<b>Okay, like that matters?</b>

16:17.630 --> 16:19.580
<b>But what about the others over there?</b>

16:17.960 --> 16:21.170
<b>Rawr! Thanks for coming to see me again!</b>

16:19.830 --> 16:21.500
<b>We're just in the same group.</b>

16:21.170 --> 16:22.380
<b>Cute as always. I-I'm so happy.</b>

16:21.880 --> 16:25.750
<b>To tell you the truth,
I have trouble fitting in with the others.</b>

16:22.380 --> 16:24.290
<b>What? Well, of course I'm cute.</b>

16:24.290 --> 16:26.540
<b>But you know, I'm really grateful.</b>

16:25.750 --> 16:27.710
<b>Especially her. We're always fighting!</b>

16:28.250 --> 16:29.380
<b>I see...</b>

16:28.920 --> 16:31.040
<b>You always come to events. I've memorized your face.</b>

16:31.040 --> 16:36.580
<b>See, I had lessons everyday as a kid
and I didn't get to school that much.</b>

16:34.580 --> 16:36.250
<b>Tote bag designed</b>

16:34.580 --> 16:36.250
<b>by Nonoka Tachibana</b>

16:34.590 --> 16:36.250
<b>Only 10 available</b>

16:36.250 --> 16:39.750
<b>Tote bag designed</b>

16:36.250 --> 16:39.750
<b>by Nonoka Tachibana</b>

16:36.250 --> 16:39.750
<b>Only 10 available</b>

16:36.580 --> 16:39.500
<b>Some people were jealous and I never made friends.</b>

16:40.040 --> 16:42.330
<b>But I swear I'm not gonna give in.</b>

16:43.790 --> 16:44.960
<b>Or whatever!</b>

16:47.380 --> 16:48.630
<b>M-me too!</b>

16:48.920 --> 16:52.420
<b>I've always been like this,
and never got along with anyone.</b>

16:53.250 --> 16:55.830
<b>So... I've always been all alone.</b>

16:56.330 --> 16:59.380
<b>Then I guess we're pretty similar.</b>

17:00.580 --> 17:01.460
<b>Similar...?</b>

17:03.210 --> 17:06.630
<b>Hey, do you have anything you love, Kimura?</b>

17:06.630 --> 17:08.420
<b>S-something I love?</b>

17:08.790 --> 17:14.250
<b>Let's see, I've been playing piano since
I was a little girl, but I'm not sure if I love it...</b>

17:14.250 --> 17:16.000
<b>You play the piano, Kimura?!</b>

17:16.000 --> 17:17.500
<b>Huh? Yes.</b>

17:18.290 --> 17:23.670
<b>That's amazing! Then someday,
I'll go listen to you perform!</b>

17:26.170 --> 17:27.170
<b>R-really?!</b>

17:27.170 --> 17:33.540
<b>Of course! Because I promised myself
that I'd never ever let my fans be all alone.</b>

17:36.580 --> 17:38.580
<b>So you'll be fine.</b>

17:39.040 --> 17:46.290
<b>Even if you don't have any friends or anything you love,
me and my songs won't ever let you feel alone.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:47.960
<b>I promise.</b>

17:48.250 --> 17:49.250
<b>All right!</b>

17:52.290 --> 17:59.710
<b>Dear Kimura,</b>

17:52.290 --> 17:59.710
<b>Someday when you're famous,</b>

17:52.290 --> 17:59.710
<b>I hope you'll write a song for me!</b>

17:52.290 --> 17:59.710
<b>Nonoka Tachibana</b>

17:53.040 --> 17:54.710
<b>I just found it.</b>

17:55.040 --> 17:55.750
<b>Huh?</b>

17:56.460 --> 17:59.130
<b>Just now, I found something I love!</b>

18:01.460 --> 18:03.580
<b>Hi, Mei. Do you want the usual?</b>

18:03.580 --> 18:05.290
<b>No. Today...</b>

18:05.710 --> 18:07.920
<b>I want to become the thing I love!</b>

18:06.960 --> 18:08.750
<b>Dear Kimura,</b>

18:06.960 --> 18:08.750
<b>Someday when you're famous,</b>

18:06.960 --> 18:08.750
<b>I hope you'll write a song for me!</b>

18:06.960 --> 18:08.750
<b>Nonoka Tachibana</b>

18:11.380 --> 18:13.960
<b>Nonoka Tachibana's gone. Forever.</b>

18:15.710 --> 18:18.630
<b>It's okay. It's just back to how things were before.</b>

18:19.040 --> 18:21.500
<b>I was always alone, anyway.</b>

18:22.420 --> 18:24.330
<b>I was always…</b>

18:24.790 --> 18:26.830
<b>different from everyone else.</b>

18:36.250 --> 18:37.960
<b>See? It's Mei's turn already!</b>

18:38.250 --> 18:40.500
<b>If you're a student here to listen, please be quiet!</b>

18:40.500 --> 18:44.250
<b>I came to keep my promise, Kimura!</b>

18:44.250 --> 18:45.790
<b>Jeez, Kano!</b>

18:50.420 --> 18:54.250
<b>My idol is here to hear me perform!</b>

19:17.500 --> 19:19.330
<b>My two favorites, next to each other!</b>

19:19.830 --> 19:21.630
<b>Tote bag designed by Nonoka Tachibana</b>

19:19.830 --> 19:21.630
<b>(tax incl.) plus shipping</b>

19:21.630 --> 19:22.210
<b>You bought the item</b>

19:21.630 --> 19:22.210
<b>Choose payment method from the Transaction page</b>

19:21.630 --> 19:22.210
<b>Close</b>

19:22.420 --> 19:23.080
<b>Yes!</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:28.960
<b>Dear Kimura,</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:28.960
<b>Someday when you're famous,</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:28.960
<b>I hope you'll write a song for me!</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:28.960
<b>Nonoka Tachibana</b>

19:36.250 --> 19:38.210
<b>Nonoka Tachibana</b>

19:39.000 --> 19:41.210
<b>Excuse me. That's my seat, all right?</b>

19:41.580 --> 19:43.460
<b>Oh, uh... What?</b>

19:44.170 --> 19:45.670
<b>Are you standing up for yourself?</b>

19:53.250 --> 19:56.500
<b>Thanks, everyone! Let's go to the next song!</b>

19:56.630 --> 20:01.830
<b>No-no-ka! No-no-ka! No-no-ka! No-no-ka!</b>

20:05.380 --> 20:08.380
<b>[Nonoka Tachibana] Impromptu Interview</b>

20:05.380 --> 20:08.380
<b>Entertainment News Recap</b>

20:05.540 --> 20:07.830
<b>Is it true that you resorted to violence?</b>

20:07.830 --> 20:09.880
<b>Did you have issues with Mero Setou from before?</b>

20:09.330 --> 20:11.670
<b>Comments</b>

20:09.330 --> 20:11.670
<b>You'd better not ever come back to the industry</b>

20:09.340 --> 20:11.670
<b>She's messed up lmao</b>

20:09.340 --> 20:11.670
<b>psycho bxxch</b>

20:09.340 --> 20:11.670
<b>Her idol days are done</b>

20:09.880 --> 20:11.830
<b>What's Producer Yukine's stance on the matter?</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.630
<b>Did anyone even like her?</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.630
<b>I mean, she's fugly</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.630
<b>I'm amazed she thought she could be an idol</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.630
<b>Who's this?</b>

20:11.670 --> 20:13.630
<b>If she's punching a person at that age, something's wrong with her</b>

20:11.830 --> 20:13.000
<b>I-I'm sorry...</b>

20:13.630 --> 20:14.040
<b>An important announcement from the Sunflower Dolls</b>

20:17.130 --> 20:17.920
<b>How do I deal with this frustration? I don't</b>

20:17.130 --> 20:17.920
<b>think an idol should ever make fans anxious like this.</b>

20:47.130 --> 20:49.210
<b>Nono-tan!</b>

20:49.460 --> 20:50.290
<b>Whoa!</b>

20:54.080 --> 20:56.920
<b>Your performance was amazing, Kimura!</b>

20:57.460 --> 21:02.170
<b>You know, Nono-tan, I wrote so many songs for you!</b>

21:03.080 --> 21:04.420
<b>Aw, thanks.</b>

21:04.960 --> 21:07.330
<b>I want to join you, too!</b>

21:07.830 --> 21:10.920
<b>Will you sing the songs I write?</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:23.960
<b>Yodogawa Camera</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:23.960
<b>Multimedia Kichijoji</b>

21:13.380 --> 21:18.330
<b>Thank you for letting me join. I'm Kimura,
a.k.a. Mei Kim Anouk Takanashi.</b>

21:18.330 --> 21:19.670
<b>Yay!</b>

21:19.920 --> 21:23.750
<b>That's really great, but I thought who
I am now betrays your expectations.</b>

21:24.170 --> 21:28.790
<b>No problem! I've decided to support both
Nonoka Tachibana and Kano Yamanouchi.</b>

21:28.790 --> 21:31.250
<b>In other words, Nono-tan as a whole package!</b>

21:31.670 --> 21:33.170
<b>Nono-tan's a package?</b>

21:33.170 --> 21:36.630
<b>Still, visually, your image back then was just the best.</b>

21:36.630 --> 21:39.130
<b>Nono-tan! Let's dye your hair black again!</b>

21:39.130 --> 21:40.710
<b>I'm gonna go check out the stuff over there.</b>

21:40.710 --> 21:42.630
<b>Awww!</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:46.130
<b>It's awesome you got to be friends with your idol, though.</b>

21:46.130 --> 21:48.630
<b>A friend? Am I?</b>

21:49.040 --> 21:49.920
<b>Aren't you?</b>

21:50.380 --> 21:51.880
<b>B-but I...</b>

21:52.210 --> 21:56.000
<b>Hey, Yoru! What do you think of this mic?</b>

21:56.880 --> 21:58.130
<b>Let's see.</b>

21:59.710 --> 22:05.330
<b>We don't have to spend more than 10,000 yen
on the mic and audio interface, according to Kiui.</b>

22:05.710 --> 22:06.580
<b>Kiui?</b>

22:06.880 --> 22:09.830
<b>Me and my idol? Friends?!</b>

22:11.500 --> 22:13.000
<b>Have we earned enough?</b>

22:14.960 --> 22:16.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

22:21.880 --> 22:24.380
<b>Sunday, November 12</b>

22:23.380 --> 22:24.790
<b>This betrays all my expectations!</b>

22:25.000 --> 22:28.710
<b>The second hand won't stop, there's no time to be feeling down</b>

22:25.000 --> 22:28.710
<b>Byoushin wa tomaranai ochikonderu hima wa nai</b>

22:28.710 --> 22:37.290
<b>Every day is packed, a list full of things I want to do</b>

22:28.710 --> 22:37.290
<b>Mainichi ga maninonrei da yaritaikoto darake no list</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.250
<b>Talking takes too long so I'll make it brief with a song</b>

22:37.500 --> 22:44.250
<b>Hanasu to nagaku natte shimau kara temijika ni uta de tsutaeru yo</b>

22:44.460 --> 22:52.130
<b>Ever since that night I found you, the rhythm started accelerating</b>

22:44.460 --> 22:52.130
<b>Kimi o mitsuketa ano yoru kara rhythm wa kasoku shihajimeta</b>

22:54.500 --> 23:02.330
<b>Only having 24 hours in a day isn't nearly enough</b>

22:54.500 --> 23:02.330
<b>Ichinichi tatta no 24 jikan ja zenzen tarinainda</b>

23:02.670 --> 23:09.330
<b>I haven't caught up to the night yet and morning's already coming</b>

23:02.670 --> 23:09.330
<b>Mada yoru ni oitsukenai noni mou asa ga kuru</b>

23:09.460 --> 23:21.750
<b>Just one hour more would do, I want to gaze
on that moon, the same moon as yours</b>

23:09.460 --> 23:21.750
<b>Ato ichijikan de iikara ano tsuki o nagamete itai kimi to onaji tsuki o</b>

23:21.960 --> 23:28.580
<b>When I fell in love with the present that's ordinary
the future got a bit more vibrant</b>

23:21.960 --> 23:28.580
<b>Arifureta ima ni koi shitara sukoshi dake saido agatta mirai</b>

23:28.580 --> 23:34.130
<b>That's how I waited for tomorrow</b>

23:28.580 --> 23:34.130
<b>Sonna fuu ni ashita o matte ita</b>
